              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>DisplayBatchInPrintFormsOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>DisplayBatchInPrintFormsExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>2466</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>In document print forms, the item presentation will be supplemented with a batch if it is specified. Batches are displayed with the &quot;Cost accounting by batches&quot; policy type only.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>در فرم‌های چاپی سند، نمایش قلم در صورت مشخص بودن بچ، با بچ تکمیل خواهد شد. بچ‌ها فقط با نوع سیاست &quot;حسابداری بهای تمام‌شده بر اساس بچ‌ها&quot; نمایش داده می‌شوند.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>В печатных формах документов представление номенклатуры будет дополнено серией, если она указана. Серии выводятся только с типом политики &quot;Учет себестоимости по сериям&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Belge yazdırma formlarında, öğenin sunumu, belirtilmişse bir parti ile desteklenecektir. Partiler, yalnızca &quot;Partilere göre maliyet&quot; politika türüyle görüntülenir.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Trong các mẫu in chứng từ, tên trình bày mặt hàng sẽ có thêm sê-ri, nếu có. Sê-ri chỉ hiển thị với kiểu chính sách &quot;Ghi nhận giá vốn theo sê-ri&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>In document print forms, the item presentation will be supplemented with a batch if it is specified. Batches are displayed with the &quot;Cost accounting by batches&quot; policy type only.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>In document print forms, the item presentation will be supplemented with a batch if it is specified. Batches are displayed with the &quot;Cost accounting by batches&quot; policy type only.</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>DisplayBatchInPrintFormsContextMenu</name>
              <id>2465</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
