        <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
          <name>GroupGroupUseGeneralizedAccountingForLowQualityProducts</name>
          <id>909</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>UseSummaryAccountingOfLowQualityGoods</name>
            <id>667</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Summary accounting of low-quality goods </value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>حسابداری خلاصه کالای کم‌کیفیت</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Contabilità generalizzata di merci scadenti</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Uogólniona ewidencja towarów niskiej jakości</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Обобщенный учет некачественных товаров</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Düşük kaliteli ürünlerin genelleştirilmiş muhasebesi</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Ghi nhận hàng kém chất lượng</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>ConstantsSet.UseSummaryAccountingOfLowQualityGoods</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
            <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>UseSummaryAccountingOfLowQualityGoodsOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>UseSummaryAccountingOfLowQualityGoodsExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>2143</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>Keep records of several low-quality goods using the same item profile. For example, for products &quot;Milk, 0.3 l.&quot;, &quot;Milk, 0.5 l.&quot;, &quot;Milk, 1 l.&quot; the same profile of spoiled goods &quot;Soured milk&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>نگهداری سوابق چند کالای کم‌کیفیت با استفاده از یک پروفایل قلم. برای مثال، برای محصولات &quot;شیر، 0.3 لیتر&quot;، &quot;شیر، 0.5 لیتر&quot;، &quot;شیر، 1 لیتر&quot; پروفایل کالای فاسد یکسان &quot;شیر ترش‌شده&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>Possibilità di registrare più articoli di bassa qualità con una singola carta articolo. Ad esempio, per i prodotti &quot; latte, 0.3 L.&quot;, &quot; latte, 0.5 L.&quot;, &quot;latte, 1 L.&quot; è possibile inserire una carta delle merci avariate - &quot;il latte è andato a male&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Możliwość ewidencji kilku towarów niskiej jakości za pomocą jednej karty nomenklatury. Na przykład, dla towarów &quot;Mleko, 0.3 l.&quot;, &quot;Mleko, 0.5 l.&quot;, &quot;Mleko, 1 l.&quot; można wprowadzić jedną kartę zepsutego towaru - &quot;Mleko skisłe&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Возможность учета нескольких некачественных товаров с помощью одной карточки номенклатуры. Например, для товаров &quot;Молоко, 0.3 л.&quot;, &quot;Молоко, 0.5 л.&quot;, &quot;Молоко, 1 л.&quot; можно ввести одну карточку испорченного товара — &quot;Молоко прокисшее&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Bir ürün profilini kullanarak birkaç düşük kaliteli ürünü muhasebeleştirme imkanı. Örneğin, &quot;Süt, 0,3 l.&quot;, &quot;Süt, 0,5 l.&quot;, &quot;Süt, 1 l.&quot; ürünleri için &quot;Ekşi süt&quot; adlı tek bir bozuk ürün profili girebilirsiniz.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Tính năng ghi nhận hàng hóa kém chất lượng bằng cách sử dụng một thẻ mặt hàng. Ví dụ: đối với các mặt hàng &quot;Sữa, 0,3 l.&quot;, &quot;Sữa, 0,5 l.&quot;, &quot;Sữa, 1 l.&quot; có thể nhập một thẻ hàng hỏng - &quot;Sữa bị chua&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>UseSummaryAccountingOfLowQualityGoodsContextMenu</name>
              <id>668</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <type>CheckBoxField</type>
            <editMode>Enter</editMode>
            <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
            <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
            <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
          </items>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Group use summary accounting of low-quality goods</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>گروه استفاده از حسابداری خلاصه کالای کم‌کیفیت</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Gruppo usa contabilità generalizzata articoli scadenti</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Grupa używaj uogólnionej ewidencji towarów niskiej jakości</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Группа использовать обобщенный учет некачественных товаров</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Grup düşük kaliteli ürünlerin genelleştirilmiş bir muhasebesini kullan</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Nhóm sử dụng kế toán tổng quát của hàng hóa bị lỗi</value>
          </title>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>GroupGroupUseGeneralizedAccountingForLowQualityProductsExtendedTooltip</name>
